[{"type":"message","user":"UH360A6GP","text":"\u003c@UH360A6GP\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1627984015.070200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"398b6a03-ddfe-4b30-a97f-88cd35a76fcf","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"今、3 タスクくらい業務外で持っていてつらみがありますｗ　すいませんｗ","ts":"1627968060.069100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":4,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U7JL1UKKL","U776661HA","UBDMG6N2J"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4jmW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"149bcdfb-e76a-481d-b115-5547bcdd9108","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ぜひつくってくれ〜という感じですねｗ","ts":"1627967843.068400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fr7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa10596f-f9a8-40f9-a6ea-39a55cbc8c89","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"すでに当該キーにマッピングされていたとしても上位レイヤとしてのマッピングができるようなイメージ","ts":"1627967749.067900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kr6O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5602b411-b427-49be-9572-2644cad2466d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"頭のいいキーマッピング管理機構はイメージとしては下記で\n```await keymap(denops, 'i', '\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;', (fallback) =\u0026gt; {\n  if (await pumvisible(denops) !== 1) {\n    return fallback(); // lexima.vim の \u0026lt;CR\u0026gt; のマッピングなどにフォールバック\n  }\n  // do something...\n})```\nこんな感じです。","ts":"1627967703.067100","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1627967730.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yosasou","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ys+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5a5ba59-1ee2-45e5-ae01-6820140545ae","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"上のアレでも使ったstdのanonymousを使えば行けそう","ts":"1627967642.065900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yosasou","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1fX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d16a7fe3-7c11-4f3a-a5bd-60a03ee48110","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"イメージとしては `await feedkeys(denops, 'iSUPER_TEXT', () =\u0026gt; { ... })` をやると、内部的には `iSUPER_TEXT\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(denops-feedkeys-callback:1)` して、キューを管理してコールバックを叩く。的なことをする必要がありますね。（しかも同期で）","ts":"1627967575.064300","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1627967592.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sFb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa7eef97-b8f6-4a5f-80c5-907fb3c097c5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"coc extensionを作る気はないし","ts":"1627967543.063700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JpC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74ff48a1-ded2-4b35-a528-3b4c17e2b0b6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"cocはそのへんの便利ツールでだいぶ先を行ってるような気がするのでdenopsにも欲しい","ts":"1627967534.063100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4zX89"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa2df847-5ddb-42c0-949f-9c5dce0bee22","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なるほど..","ts":"1627967503.061700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GQ4BJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d0a10f4-0dc8-4548-9f15-996099044192","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"vsnip なんかは feedkeys のコールバックみたいなのを自力で頑張って実施しており、テストに役立てていたりします。\n（`call feedkeys(‘…’, ‘x’)` だと、実行後にノーマルモードに戻ってから確認することになる。例えば select-mode でちゃんと意図した範囲が select できているか？を確認することはできない。（はず））","ts":"1627967466.061400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qPG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"663f6fa3-d217-48ba-a125-355b5c78b4db","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"feedkeys はいくつか用法がありまして、例えば、キーマッピングのテストを書きたい！という場合、vim 側にコールバックしてもらわないといけなかったり\nあとは、feedkeys でカレント行にパッチ当てる実装をすると、dot-repeatable にできる（setbuflline や substitute はできない）","ts":"1627967390.060000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zb2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2dff1f78-12a0-4ca4-80fc-9615dcd00e9c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"feedkeyはより正確にはちゃんとしたユーザー入力エミュレーション、って感じですかね(タイミング系問題もあるので)","ts":"1627967334.058900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wmK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69019b7a-08c4-4879-be29-26310741b349","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"プラグイン作っててほんとに欲しくなる機能。\n1. augroup とか気にせずに subscribe/unsubscribe できるイベント管理機構\n2. feedkeys でコールバックもらえる機能\n3. setbufline 可能な空バッファを安全に作成する機能\n4. floatwin を管理する機能\n5. バッファの差分検知\n6. nexttick 的な機能（ `timer_start(0, { -\u0026gt; denops#dispatch(…) }` を await すればいけるといえばいける）（textlock 回避向け）\n7. 頭のいいキーマッピング管理機構","ts":"1627967244.058000","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1627967303.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1WGO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6da81c5-028b-40cc-ac11-8f148fe723fc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"プラグインも作らずに何をやっているのだ一体","ts":"1627917715.055000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b8eK6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e582004-6aa6-4c10-b596-db849fcf4a34","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"本当は(仮に本家に提供するなら)`\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;`使うべきではないしもうちょい考慮することもある気がするけどまあ雑ということで","ts":"1627917434.054700","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1627917843.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vlsUD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80264784-38bc-4325-b56a-d